      "code": "C23C8/00",
      "level": 7,
      "parent": null,
      "ja": "金属質材料表面への非金属元素のみの固相拡散（けい素の拡散Ｃ２３Ｃ１０／００）；表面と反応性ガスとの反応による金属質材料の化学的表面処理，であって表面材料の反応生成物を被覆層中に残すもの，例．化成被覆，金属の不働態化（Ｃ２３Ｃ１４／００が優先）",
      "en": "Solid state diffusion of only non-metal elements into metallic material surfaces (diffusion of silicon C23C10/00); Chemical surface treatment of metallic material by reaction of the surface with a reactive gas, leaving reaction products of surface material in the coating, e.g. conversion coatings, passivation of metals (C23C14/00 takes precedence)",
